# Mobile View Usage — VStack/HStack Only

**In `apps/mobile-app`:** Use **VStack** and **HStack** for ALL layout and grouping. Do NOT use raw **View** for layout.

## Non-negotiable

- **Layout:** VStack or HStack only. Never View for layout.
- **Dynamic styles:** VStack/HStack accept `style` prop — use them with `style={{ backgroundColor: x }}` when colors are dynamic. Do not fall back to View.
- **Before finishing:** Scan for `View` usage. Replace with VStack/HStack unless it matches an allowed exception below.

## Allowed View exceptions (add comment when used)

- **Divider line:** `View className="h-px flex-1 bg-border"` inside HStack — add `{/* View used: divider line; do not change. */}`
- **Third-party API:** When a native component (e.g. MapView, createAnimatedComponent(ScrollView)) requires View
- **Platform-specific workaround:** When View is required for a platform quirk

## Wrong vs right

- **Wrong:** `<View style={{ backgroundColor: bg }}><Ionicons /></View>` for icon container
- **Right:** `<VStack spacing="none" align="center" justify="center" className="h-10 w-10 rounded-lg" style={{ backgroundColor: bg }}><Ionicons /></VStack>`

- **Wrong:** `<View style={{ paddingHorizontal: 12, ... }}><Text>Status</Text></View>` for badge
- **Right:** `<VStack spacing="none" align="center" justify="center" className="rounded-full px-3 py-1" style={{ backgroundColor: statusStyle.bg }}><Text style={{ color: statusStyle.text }}>Status</Text></VStack>`

## Verification

Before submitting any mobile component: confirm no View used for layout. If View remains, it must have a comment explaining the exception.
